    planted a DAC->ADC connection in a copy of QEMU's duplex codec
    EOF
    $ python check_claim.py hw_audio_hda-codec-common.PLANT.h
    node 1: name=func conn=[]
    node 2: name=dac conn=[]
    node 3: name=out conn=[2]
    node 4: name=adc conn=[5, 3]
    node 5: name=in conn=[]
